('a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'Boncuk', 'dog', 'Golden Retriever', 3, 6, 'female', true, 28.5, 'Loves belly rubs and chasing seagulls along the Bosphorus. Very friendly with all dogs and people!', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552053831-71594a27632d?w=600', '{friendly,playful,energetic}', '{"Walking Buddy","Playdate","Social Group"}', 'Cihangir', 'large', 'high', 'any', '{"medium","large"}', '{"Morning Walker","Park Regular","Beach Lover"}', 41.0325, 28.9835, false),
